      "statement": "On the tiny lane Phase 5 commits the red test at the diagnosis Seam before the fix commit and records red/green rows. With `Seam: none — <reason>` it records a SUMMARY finding and `Red test exempt: <reason>`. Normal and high-risk lanes continue the lane route with diagnosis.md as input.",
